1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,430
If you hid

2
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,565
behind this wall…

3
00:00:01,565 --> 00:00:02,225
this machine could

4
00:00:02,225 --> 00:00:03,590
STILL WATCH YOU.

5
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:04,810
Scientists built a system

6
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:05,700
that shoots invisible

7
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,350
radio waves

8
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,315
THROUGH walls.

9
00:00:07,315 --> 00:00:07,935
And when they bounce

10
00:00:07,935 --> 00:00:08,875
off your body,

11
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:09,555
AI creates

12
00:00:09,555 --> 00:00:11,245
a moving SKELETON of you.

13
00:00:11,245 --> 00:00:12,090
Raise your hand?

14
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:13,365
It raises its hand.

15
00:00:13,365 --> 00:00:14,005
But here's where

16
00:00:14,005 --> 00:00:15,265
it gets CREEPY.

17
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:16,515
In a separate experiment,

18
00:00:16,515 --> 00:00:17,305
scientists used

19
00:00:17,305 --> 00:00:18,725
ordinary Wi-Fi signals

20
00:00:18,725 --> 00:00:19,365
to IDENTIFY

21
00:00:19,365 --> 00:00:20,750
people walking past.

22
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:21,330
Even WITHOUT

23
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:22,375
their phones.

24
00:00:22,375 --> 00:00:22,815
They tested

25
00:00:22,815 --> 00:00:24,665
197 people…

26
00:00:24,665 --> 00:00:25,305
and identified

27
00:00:25,305 --> 00:00:27,090
almost EVERYONE correctly.

28
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:27,680
So imagine

29
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,205
walking past a café,

30
00:00:29,205 --> 00:00:30,185
and it recognizes you

31
00:00:30,185 --> 00:00:32,000
without you doing ANYTHING.

32
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:32,770
Now would you rather

33
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:33,400
have a CAMERA

34
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,410
watching you…

35
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:35,010
Or Wi-Fi

36
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,417
that knows who you are?

